#: kardview.cpp:264
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"You finished the game in %1 tries.\n"
"The best you could have done is %2 tries.\n"
"Do you want to play again?"
msgstr ""
"សូម​អបអរ​សាទរ !\n"
"អ្នកបាន​បញ្ចប់​ល្បែង %1 ដង ។\n"
"ល្អ​បំផុត​ដែល​អ្នក​អាច​ធ្វើ​គឺ %2 ដង ។\n"
"តើអ្នក​ចង់​លេង​ម្ដង​ទៀត​ទេ ?"

